[en.CHARACTER_MARBLE_PIE_NAME]
Marble Pie

[en.CHARACTER_MARBLE_PIE_DESC]
Marble Pie is the youngest of the Pie sisters, characterized by her timid and indecisive nature. Interacting with ponies outside of the Pie family is a challenging task for her. However, beneath this shy exterior lies genuine kindness and love for the quarry farm and her family members. The Last Roundup forever altered her once ordinary days. As an indispensable member of the Pie family, she strives to overcome her shyness in order to help as many ponies as possible. Marble serves as a calming influence when her sisters make decisions, contributing to the stability of their family.

[zh.CHARACTER_MARBLE_PIE_NAME]
玉琪派

[zh.CHARACTER_MARBLE_PIE_DESC]
玉琪派是派家族四姐妹当中最小的那一位，她天性胆小、优柔寡断，和除派家族以外的小马交流对她而言都是一件很困难的事情，但潜藏在这颗害羞之心下的是最真挚的善良和对采石农场、家庭成员的热爱。终末之战永远带走了她本应平凡的日子，作为派家族不可或缺的一份子，为了尽可能帮助到更多的小马，她正在努力改变自己的害羞之心，并且在她的姐姐们决策时充当镇定剂的作用。
